@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
title 012 活動結果回填｜Class（實作對應，人工驗收待完成）
class "教師" as Teacher
class "課程" as Course
class "原課堂" as Room
class "原課堂組別" as Group {
  group_id
  name : canonical 組號字串 1..999
  display_label : 第 N 組
}
class "活動脈絡" as Activity {
  activity_id
  name
  semantic_times
}
class "固定講義版本" as Catalog {
  import_id / version
  source_sheet
}
class "結算快照" as Snapshot {
  result_version
}
class "題組結果" as Unit {
  winner_group_id : optional
  answers
}
class "回填預覽" as Preview {
  preview_id
  original_values
  proposed_values
}
class "操作報告" as Report {
  operation_id
  readback_status
  overwrite_consent
}
Teacher "1" -- "*" Course
Course "1" -- "*" Room
Room "1" -- "*" Group
Room "1" -- "*" Activity
Activity "*" --> "1" Catalog : 固定版本
Activity "1" -- "0..1" Snapshot : 已結算
Snapshot "1" -- "*" Unit
Unit "*" --> "0..1" Group : 僅允許原課堂
Activity "1" -- "*" Preview
Preview --> Catalog
Preview --> Snapshot
Preview "1" -- "0..1" Report
Report --> Preview : 恢復預覽保留原快照
note bottom of Group
  標籤僅供顯示，不代替 group_id。
  不同課堂的第 1 組各自獨立。
  實際資料為 classroom_groups.id / classroom_id / name。
  group_label(name) 由 Issue 16 提供；本功能不新增組號欄位。
end note
note bottom of Preview
  以原活動建立；不依目前活動或名稱重查歸屬。
  關課／清單移除不刪除歷史依賴。
  此為概念關係，非新增資料表承諾。
  label/context 僅作教師投影，不改 snapshot digest。
  context 錯誤不刪除原報告或改原操作狀態。
end note
@enduml
